 **Phase 4**, plus deploy wiring:\n\n- Phase 0–3: orgId, OrgSwitcher, create school, platform ops\n- Phase 4: Auth custom claims + production Firestore Rules\n- Client calls `refreshOwnAuthClaims` when ID token lags profile\n- Runbook: `docs/superpowers/plans/2026-07-29-deploy-runbook.md`\n\n## Deploy status (this cloud agent)\n\n**Could not deploy Firebase from this environment** — no `firebase login` / `FIREBASE_TOKEN` / `secrets/serviceAccount.json`.\n\nTo deploy from a machine with credentials (order matters):\n\n1. `npm run deploy:auth-claims-functions`\n2. `APPLY=1 GOOGLE_APPLICATION_CREDENTIALS=./secrets/serviceAccount.json npm run migrate:sync-auth-claims` (+ Phase 0 orgId backfill if needed)\n3. `npm run deploy:firestore-indexes`\n4. `npm run deploy:firestore-rules`\n5. Merge to `main` for GitHub Pages hosting\n\n## Verification\n\n- 209 tests + app build green\n- Functions `tsc` green\n\n<!-- CURSOR_AGENT_PR_BODY_END -->\n\n<div><a href=\"https://cursor.com/agents/bc-019fab7d-aae7-717a-95eb-31528ec13c2e\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Web\" width=\"114\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-web-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;<a href=\"https://cursor.com/background-agent?bcId=bc-019fab7d-aae7-717a-95eb-31528ec13c2e\"><picture><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: dark)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"><source media=\"(prefers-color-scheme: light)\" srcset=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-light.png\"><img alt=\"Open in Cursor\" width=\"131\" height=\"28\" src=\"https://cursor.com/assets/images/open-in-cursor-dark.png\"></picture></a>&nbsp;</div>\n\n","closed_by":{"login":"cursor[bot]","id":206951365,"node_id":"BOT_kgDODFXTxQ","avatar_url":"https://avatars.githu